<main>

# My Blog

Posts are plain Markdown files in `site/pages/posts/` — that folder is a typed
content collection, and this index is one `.wd` loop over it. No manifest, no
config, zero JavaScript; each post's frontmatter is the data.

@loop posts into post sort by post.date desc
::: post-card
### [{ post.title }]({ post.url })
::: post-meta
{ post.date }
:::
{ post.excerpt }
:::
@empty
No posts yet — add a `.md` file to `site/pages/posts/`.
@endloop

</main>
